	(text "RGB LED aktivní v nule (ArduPilot GPIO_LED_RGB), ~3–5 mA.\nBzučák: aktivní 5 V (piezo) na padech BZ+/BZ−, BUZZ_ON_LVL 1, bez diody jako MicoAir.\nR319 drží Q301 vypnutý, dokud MCU nenastaví PD15."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 167.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b2294723-eb1c-59b7-b91c-fa35561a19ed")
	)
	(text "Y301: CL 12 pF, C = 2 × (CL − Cstray) = 2 × (12 − 5) = 14 → 15 pF [AN4938, AN2867].\ngm_crit = 4·ESR·(2πf)²·(C0+CL)² ≈ 0,5 mA/V (ESR 180 Ω, C0 ≤ 5 pF) < Gmcritmax 1,5 mA/V [DS12110]."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 60.96 106.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "002b2f2e-a2e6-5c0a-b4b4-93f661f7572c")
	)
	(text "U302: SPL06-001 a DPS310 mají stejné pouzdro i piny (jako BMP280).\nCSB a SDO na 3,3 V → I2C, adresa 0x77. Osadit podle skladu JLC."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 330.2 177.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a90873b0-671e-5d95-956f-806bf2ec0dca")
	)
	(text "U303 BMI088 jako MicoAir: SPI2, PS = GND (SPI),\nSDO1+SDO2 = MISO, INT1 = data ready akcel., INT3 = gyro."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 266.7 177.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4ed0f147-3f3a-5157-83ce-435f13736c85")
	)
	(text "J302 microSD na SDMMC1, pull-upy 47k na CMD a D0–D3 (SD: 10–100k)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 251.46 96.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "92889b8d-4d8f-58db-8966-b2273d612a15")
	)
